  (lib_symbols)
  (text
    "GERBERUS KITCHEN SINK\nOne sheet per feature, each with a deliberate pass case and a deliberate fail case.\nREADME.md lists every part's purpose and what Gerberus reports. Sheets talk through buses\n(CANA{TXD RXD}, CANB{TXD RXD}, I2C{SCL SDA}, LED[0..2]) and plain hierarchical pins.\nSPICE stress checks: placeholder, to be added once Gerberus has them."
